(Chapter 1: Photosynthesis) '
(Photosynthesis converts light energy into chemical energy in chloroplasts.) '
(Section 1.1 Light reactions: chlorophyll absorbs light, water is split, oxygen is released,) '
(ATP and NADPH are produced in the thylakoid membranes.) '
(Section 1.2 Calvin cycle: carbon dioxide is fixed by RuBisCO into sugars in the stroma.) '
ET
endstream
