(Chapter 3: Cell division) '
(Section 3.1 Mitosis: prophase, metaphase, anaphase, telophase produce two identical cells.) '
(Section 3.2 Meiosis: two divisions produce four haploid gametes with genetic variation) '
(through crossing over and independent assortment.) '
